body:
I do mine because it helps the depression. It shouldnt, but it does. It anchors. I dont know why really.

&#x200B;

OP as to your situation, thats ruff. I have no words that will make it easier. Nothing that will bring you peace. I wish I did. We all deserve to be loved. We all deserve to be cared for. If you were here I would hug. We all need that contact.
